  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Hub\n\t\tCapium Hub Client Information\n\n### Capium Hub\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 5 Feb, 2024 at  9:17 AM\n\n\t\tCapium Hub\n\nThis Article Provides the Step by Step Guide in Create a client user and access to Hub\n\nAdding Client User \n\nNavigation: My Admin>User>Add New User\n\nUnder this section click on New User and Select  User Type as Client. By this you will be able to add the Client User. Once selected the user type as client populate the relevant fields and Save  \n\nThis can be done individually or Import the Users in Bulk using  csv,  populate the relevant fields and upload it.\n\nPlease refer the below Screenshot\n\nAccess to Hub\n\nNavigation: My Admin>My Subscription>Hub\n\nUnder this Section. You can provide the Hub Access to clients using the Hub Access Toggle button as yes/no to your Client.\n\nPlease refer the below Screenshot\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117301\">Capium Hub</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000195364\">Capium Hub Client Information</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium Hub\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 5 Feb, 2024 at  9:17 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Capium Hub</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This Article Provides the Step by Step Guide in Create a client user and access to Hub</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Adding Client User&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation: My Admin&gt;User&gt;Add New User</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Under this section click on New User and Select &nbsp;User Type as Client. By this you will be able to add the Client User. Once selected the user type as client populate the relevant fields and Save &nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This can be done individually or Import the Users in Bulk using &nbsp;csv, &nbsp;populate the relevant fields and upload it.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Please refer the below Screenshot</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:251px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9204862006/original/TpuiBRggI4njVzTvRxDAJiVVTEdQBT7n3A.png?1707124569\" width=\"602\" height=\"251\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9204862006\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Access to Hub</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation: My Admin&gt;My Subscription&gt;Hub</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Under this Section. You can provide the Hub Access to clients using the Hub Access Toggle bu